<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Bear Stearns ups First Union.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Bear Stearns ups First Union.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns analyst Larry Vitale confirmed he raised his rating on First Union Corp to attractive from neutral.</p>
<p>-- He declined to comment further.</p>
<p>-- The stock fell 1/8 to 79-7/8.</p>
</text>
